UNICORN HORNS:

1. It will cure blindness, confusion, hallucination, sickness, or stunning
   when a)pplied, without running out. 
2. It will clear up a potion of sickness, hallucination, and the potion of
   confusion when #d)ipped in it, and not damage others.  Good test for 
   bad potions. A hint, 'interesting' means that nothing has happened. 
3. Won't rust.  You can also enchant them, thus they make great weapons 
   against rust monsters, green jellies, acid blobs, and all of them 
   creatures. 

WARNING!  A CURSED HORN WILL CAUSE THE ABOVE EFFECTS! (This can be helpful
if you want to be blind or confused -- both can be useful) WARNING! Even
if you want to use this effect, the horn also occasionally lowers stats.

